---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/siteUrl';
---

<Layout
  title="Logo Design"
  description="Build marks, wordmarks, and brand assets in Varve's Design workspace with vector editing, Logo project tools, audits, and export."
>
  <div class="container-custom">
    <article class="feature-page">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href={sitePath('/features')}>Features</a> / Logo Design
      </nav>
      <h1 class="site-page-title">Logo tools inside Design</h1>
      <p class="feature-intro">
        Create marks, wordmarks, monograms, and brand assets in the Design workspace. Logo is a
        focused toolset inside the shared editor, so logo work keeps the same document, selection,
        viewport, and history as the rest of your design work.
      </p>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>From first path to delivery</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Use node editing, pen and shape tools, Boolean operations, and text outlining to refine a mark.</li>
          <li>Keep logo project details and clear-space guides with the document.</li>
          <li>Review vector and small-size risks, then export the artwork through the shared export workflow.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          The former Logo shortcut, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>6</kbd>, opens Design and
          shows Logo Tools. You can also open the Logo panel from the View menu or command palette.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-section">
        <h2>A design workflow, not a separate document mode</h2>
        <p>
          Logo work uses the same scene and editing tools as Design. The panel adds logo-specific
          project controls and checks; changing workspace does not create a logo-only copy of your
          document. See <a href={sitePath('/features/vector-tools')}>Vector Tools</a> and
          <a href={sitePath('/features/export')}>Export</a> for the underlying editing and delivery
          workflows.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p><a href={sitePath('/features/workspaces')}>Explore all six workspaces</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .feature-page { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 0; }
  .breadcrumb { font-size: .875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .feature-intro { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 1rem 0 3rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .feature-section { margin: 0 0 3rem; }
  .feature-section h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .feature-section p, .feature-section li { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }
  .feature-section li + li { margin-top: .65rem; }
</style>
